/-!
# Proper simple sections of the small odd classical alternatives

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, Theorem 0.1.2(4) and condition K, printed pp.4
and 482 of `refs/quasithin.pdf`. The alternatives are PSL₃(3), PSL₄(3),
PSU₃(3), and PSU₄(3), with unitary matrices over a field of order nine.

The PSL₃(3) branch is proved: all proper subgroups are solvable, so all
their simple sections are prime cyclic. Its catalogue theorem leaves only
inclusion in the full known-simple catalogue explicit. The PSL₄(3), PSU₃(3),
and PSU₄(3) section classifications remain to be supplied before this module
can assert the combined odd classical proper-K theorem.
-/
